-- title:
--   Away units of R∩ s_f̂ R s_f⁻¹ at a near-global idele
-- statement:
--   Fix rationals $a,b$ and the quaternion algebra $\mathbb{H}[\mathbb{Q},a,b]$. Let $R$ be a $\mathbb{Z}$-submodule of it satisfying [`QuaternionAlgebra.IsOrder`](def/QuaternionAlgebra_Order.html#L11): $1\in R$, $R$ is closed under multiplication, its $\mathbb{Q}$-span is everything, and it is finitely generated. Let $q$ be a natural number, prime, let $v$ be a height-one prime of $\mathcal{O}_{\mathbb{Q}}$ with $q\in v$, let $s$ be a unit of $\mathbb{H}[\mathbb{Q},a,b]$ and $s_f$ a unit of $\mathbb{H}[\mathbb{Q},a,b]\otimes_{\mathbb{Q}}\mathbb{A}_{\mathbb{Q},f}$ whose component at every height-one prime $u$ not containing $q$ equals $s\otimes 1$. For an order $\Lambda$ write $\mathrm{awayUnits}(\Lambda,v)$ for the intersection, over all height-one primes $w\neq v$, of the preimages under $\mathbb{H}[\mathbb{Q},a,b]^{\times}\to(\mathbb{H}[\mathbb{Q},a,b]\otimes_{\mathbb{Q}}\mathbb{Q}_w)^{\times}$ of the subgroups generated by the units lying, together with their inverses, in the local box $\Lambda_w$. The assertion is that for the order $\mathrm{meetOrder}(R,s_f)=R\cap\mathrm{conjByFiniteIdele}(R,s_f)$, the intersection of $R$ with the pullback to $\mathbb{H}[\mathbb{Q},a,b]$ of $s_f\hat R s_f^{-1}$, one has $\mathrm{awayUnits}(\mathrm{meetOrder}(R,s_f),v)=\mathrm{awayUnits}(R,v)\cap s\,\mathrm{awayUnits}(R,v)\,s^{-1}$, the second factor being the image of $\mathrm{awayUnits}(R,v)$ under conjugation by $s$.
--
--   This identifies the $q$-away unit group of the order cut out by a level-raising idele which is globally $s$ away from $q$ with the group $\Gamma\cap s\Gamma s^{-1}$ attached to $R$, the shape in which level structures appear in the Čerednik–Drinfeld coset-graph description of Shimura curves. It is used in the construction of the Hecke tower and Atkin–Lehner relations on the coset graph, and in the comparison of quotients of the graph with the quaternionic class sets.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_CerednikDrinfeld_CosetGraph_awayUnits_meetOrder_eq_inf_map_conj_of_finiteAdeleEvalAt_eq.lean

